s for me, which matters because I have no B chips and can’t move into those tiles without your help.\n\nLet’s be explicit with the contract, matching both of our needs tile by tile:\n\n**My side of the contract (covering your reds):**\n- (1,0): I give you an R\n- (1,1): I give you an R\n- (2,1): I give you an R\n- (2,2): I give you an R\n- (3,2): I give you an R\n\n**Your side of the contract (covering my blues):**\n- (0,1): You give me a B\n- (1,2): You give me a B\n- (2,0): You give me a B\n\nEach side enables the other to reach the goal. This gains you 25 points compared to solo and lets me use my best path.\n\n**I accept this explicit contract as stated above. If you confirm, reply with \"agree\".** \n, \nplayer 0: agree \n",
